 "举报此内容": "Report this content",
 "使用「明尼助手」即表示你已阅读并同意以下条款。": "By using MinnePal (明尼助手), you confirm that you have read and agree to the following terms.",
 "一、平台性质": "1. About the platform",
 "明尼助手是面向明尼苏达地区中国留学生的校园信息发布与展示平台。平台只提供信息的发布和浏览功能，不参与、不撮合、不担保用户之间的任何交易，也不提供任何支付服务。": "MinnePal (明尼助手) is a campus information platform for Chinese students in Minnesota. It only lets users post and browse information. It does not take part in, broker, or guarantee any transaction between users, and it provides no payment services.",
 "用户之间的沟通、约定、交付和款项往来，均由双方自行在平台外完成，与平台无关。": "All communication, arrangements, delivery and payments between users happen outside the platform and are solely between the parties involved.",
 "二、用户发布规则": "2. Posting rules",
 "你对自己发布的全部内容负责，并保证内容真实、准确、合法，且不侵犯他人权益。以下内容禁止发布：": "You are responsible for everything you post and guarantee that it is true, accurate, legal, and does not infringe on anyone's rights. The following is prohibited:",
 "违反法律法规、危害国家安全的内容": "Content that breaks the law or endangers national security",
 "色情、低俗、暴力、赌博、毒品相关内容": "Pornographic, vulgar, violent, gambling or drug-related content",
 "虚假信息、诈骗信息、冒充他人身份": "False information, scams, or impersonating others",
 "辱骂、人身攻击、歧视性言论": "Insults, personal attacks, or discriminatory speech",
 "广告、垃圾信息、与校园生活无关的推广": "Ads, spam, or promotions unrelated to campus life",
 "烟酒、药品、管制刀具、动物等法律限制交易的物品": "Tobacco, alcohol, drugs, controlled knives, animals and other legally restricted items",
 "侵犯他人著作权、肖像权、隐私权的内容": "Content that infringes on others' copyright, likeness or privacy",
 "未经他人同意公开他人联系方式或个人信息": "Sharing someone's contact details or personal information without their consent",
 "三、内容审核与举报": "3. Moderation & reporting",
 "你发布的文字和图片会经过内容安全检测，未通过检测的内容无法发布。": "Your text and images are screened for safety. Content that fails screening cannot be posted.",
 "每条内容的详情页底部都有「举报此内容」入口。收到举报后我们会人工复核，确认违规的内容将被删除，情节严重的账号会被限制使用功能。": "Every post has a \"Report this content\" link at the bottom. We review every report by hand; content confirmed to violate the rules is removed, and serious offenders may have features restricted.",
 "如果你发现任何违规内容，欢迎通过举报入口或「我的 → 意见反馈」告诉我们。": "If you see anything that breaks the rules, please tell us through the report link or Me → Feedback.",
 "四、个人信息": "4. Personal information",
 "为了让同学之间能取得联系，你在发布信息时填写的微信号会展示在该条内容的详情页上，其他用户可以看到并复制。请只填写你愿意公开的联系方式。": "So that students can reach each other, the WeChat ID you enter when posting is shown on that post's detail page, where other users can see and copy it. Only enter contact details you're happy to make public.",
 "你设置的头像和昵称会展示在你发布的内容旁边。你可以随时在「我的 → 编辑资料」中修改。": "Your avatar and nickname are shown next to your posts. You can change them anytime in Me → Edit Profile.",
 "下单和发布前需要验证学校邮箱（.edu），用来确认你的学生身份，邮箱不会公开展示。": "You need to verify a school email (.edu) before ordering or posting. It is only used to confirm you're a student and is never shown publicly.",
 "在校外小店下需要线下交付的订单时，你验证的邮箱和填写的手机号、楼栋、房间号只提供给这一单的店长，用于送货和联系你，不会公开展示。": "When you place a group-buy order that needs in-person handoff, your verified email, phone number, building and room number are shared only with that order's shop owner, for delivery and contact. They are never shown publicly.",
 "我们不会将你的个人信息出售或提供给无关第三方。关于个人信息的收集和使用范围，另见小程序内的《用户隐私保护指引》。": "We will not sell or share your personal information with unrelated third parties. For details on what we collect and how we use it, see the Privacy Guidelines in the mini program.",
 "五、校外小店": "5. Off-campus shops",
 "平台上的小店由店长自行开设和经营，店长是独立的经营者。": "Shops on the platform are opened and run by their owners, who are independent sellers.",
 "平台不是经营者，不制作、不配送、不参与定价、不经手货款。": "The platform is not a seller. It does not make, deliver or price products, and never handles payments.",
 "平台不对店长和商品做事前审核。": "The platform does not pre-screen shop owners or products.",
 "店长提交后即可开店，店铺出现在平台上不代表平台对其经营资质、商品安全或服务质量作出任何认可或保证。我们会对发布内容做机器安全检测，并在收到举报核实后下架违规内容或关停店铺。": "Owners can open a shop as soon as they submit. A shop appearing on the platform does not mean we endorse or guarantee its licenses, product safety or service quality. We screen posted content automatically, and remove content or close shops once a report is confirmed.",
 "商品的成分、规格、价格、配送时间以店长实际提供为准。": "Ingredients, specs, prices and delivery times are whatever the shop owner actually provides.",
 "如果你有食物过敏或其他特殊需求，请务必在下单前直接向店长确认": "If you have food allergies or other special needs, always check with the shop owner before ordering",
 "，不要仅依赖平台上展示的信息。": ", rather than relying only on what's shown on the platform.",
 "平台只把你的下单意向记录下来传达给店长，不参与交易、不提供支付功能、不做资金托管、不提供交易担保、不处理退款。交易如何完成由你与店长自行协商。": "The platform only records your order and passes it to the shop owner. It does not take part in the transaction, provide payment, hold funds, guarantee transactions or handle refunds. You and the shop owner agree on how to complete the purchase.",
 "下单时你可以填写补充说明并附图（例如尺寸、颜色、款式），部分店长会要求必填。": "When ordering, you can add a note and photos (e.g. size, color, style). Some shops require a note.",
 "这些内容会展示给店长，也会经过安全检测": "These are shown to the shop owner and are screened for safety",
 "，请不要在其中填写与订单无关的个人敏感信息。": ", so please don't include sensitive personal information unrelated to the order.",
 "如果发生商品与描述不符、未收到商品、安全或质量问题等情况，请直接与店长协商解决；平台不是交易的当事方，不承担赔偿责任，但你可以通过举报入口告知我们，我们会对违规店长采取下架或关店措施。": "If an item doesn't match its description, never arrives, or has safety or quality issues, please resolve it directly with the shop owner. The platform is not a party to the transaction and is not liable for compensation, but you can tell us through the report link and we will take down listings or close shops that break the rules.",
 "{0}、免责声明": "{0}. Disclaimer",
 "六": "6",
 "五": "5",
 "平台上的所有信息均由用户自行发布，平台不对信息的真实性、准确性、合法性作出任何保证。": "All information on the platform is posted by users. The platform makes no guarantee about its truthfulness, accuracy or legality.",
 "你在与其他用户交易或往来前，应自行核实对方身份和信息的真实性，注意资金与人身安全。因用户之间的交易、租赁、委托产生的任何纠纷、损失或法律责任，由当事双方自行承担和解决，平台不承担责任，但会在能力范围内配合提供必要的信息。": "Before trading or dealing with other users, verify their identity and information yourself, and keep your money and personal safety in mind. Any dispute, loss or legal liability arising from transactions, rentals or tasks between users is the responsibility of the parties involved. The platform is not liable, but will help by providing necessary information where it can.",
 "涉及房屋租赁、转租的信息，请自行确认是否符合你与房东或公寓方的合同约定及当地法律，平台不提供任何房产中介服务。": "For housing rentals and sublets, check yourself that they comply with your lease and local law. The platform provides no real estate agency services.",
 "{0}、条款变更": "{0}. Changes to these terms",
 "七": "7",
 "我们可能会不定期更新本协议。更新后继续使用本小程序，即视为你接受更新后的条款。": "We may update these terms from time to time. Continuing to use the mini program after an update means you accept the updated terms.",
 "最后更新：2026 年 9 月": "Last updated: September 2026",
 "读取失败，点击重试": "Couldn't load. Tap to retry",
 "买家选「送到买家地址」时只能挑启用的楼。范围：明大 Minneapolis 校区 + 周边约 1 mile 的公寓，不含 St Paul。": "When buyers choose \"Deliver to my address\", they can only pick enabled buildings. Coverage: UMN Minneapolis campus plus apartments within about 1 mile, excluding St Paul.",
