 "有什么要": "Anything to ",
 "分享": "share",
 "的？": "?",
 "待处理": "Pending",
 "已处理": "Resolved",
 "没有待处理的举报": "No pending reports",
 "还没有处理过的举报": "No resolved reports yet",
 "（内容已删除）": "(Content deleted)",
 "举报原因：{0}": "Reason: {0}",
 "下架": "Take down",
 "删除内容": "Delete content",
 "不违规": "No violation",
 "已{0}": "{0}",
 "驳回": "Dismiss",
 "你是店长：买家把配送费一起付给了你，这些钱要结给配送队。": "You're the shop owner: buyers paid you the delivery fee too, and it needs to go to the delivery team.",
 "你是配送队：这些配送费由店长代收，需要向店长结算。": "You're the delivery team: the shop owner collected these delivery fees and needs to settle with you.",
 "待结算": "To settle",
 "没有待结算的配送费。订单完成后会自动累计到这里。": "Nothing to settle. Delivery fees add up here automatically when orders are completed.",
 "{0} 单": "{0} orders",
 "收款方式：": "Payment method: ",
 "队长微信：": "Team lead WeChat: ",
 "发起对账": "Start settlement",
 "账单记录": "Bills",
 "还没有账单": "No bills yet",
 "{0} 单 · {1} ~ {2}": "{0} orders · {1} ~ {2}",
 "转到：": "Pay to: ",
 "我已转账": "I've paid",
 "确认收到": "Confirm received",
 "等店长转账": "Waiting for shop owner to pay",
 "等队伍确认": "Waiting for team to confirm",
 "撤回": "Withdraw",
 "本告知书适用于在「明尼助手」上开设店铺、发布商品并接收订单的店长。提交开店申请即表示你已完整阅读并同意以下全部条款。": "These terms apply to shop owners who open a shop, list products and receive orders on MinnePal. By applying to open a shop, you confirm that you have read and agree to all of the following.",
 "一、你与平台的关系": "1. Your relationship with the platform",
 "你是": "You are ",
 "独立的经营者": "an independent seller",
 "。你不是本平台的员工、雇员、代理人、承包商或合作方，平台与你之间不构成劳动关系、雇佣关系、合伙关系或代理关系。": ". You are not an employee, agent, contractor or partner of the platform, and there is no employment, partnership or agency relationship between you and the platform.",
 "平台只提供信息展示和订单记录的技术服务：把你填写的店铺资料和商品信息展示给用户，把用户的下单意向记录下来传达给你。平台不生产、不制作、不配送、不参与定价、不介入你和用户之间的交易，也不对你的经营行为作任何背书或担保。": "The platform only provides the technical service of displaying information and recording orders: it shows your shop and product information to users, and passes users' orders on to you. The platform does not produce, make or deliver anything, does not set prices, does not get involved in transactions between you and users, and does not endorse or guarantee your business.",
 "平台不对你发布的内容做事前审核。": "The platform does not pre-screen what you post.",
 "你提交后即可开店，内容是否合规完全由你负责。平台在收到用户举报并核实后，会下架违规内容或关停店铺。": " Your shop opens as soon as you submit, and you alone are responsible for whether your content complies with the rules. Once a user report is confirmed, the platform will take down the content or close the shop.",
 "你自主决定卖什么、卖多少钱、什么时候营业、接不接某一单。平台不对你的经营作出任何指示。": "You decide what to sell, at what price, when to open, and whether to accept an order. The platform gives you no instructions about your business.",
 "二、经营资质": "2. Licenses and permits",
 "你必须自行确认并持续满足你所在地法律法规对你所经营的商品或服务的全部要求，包括但不限于营业登记、行业许可、从业资格、场地与保险要求等。平台无法也不会替你判断你的经营是否合法，请你自行向当地主管部门核实。": "You must make sure, on your own and on an ongoing basis, that you meet every legal requirement where you operate for the goods or services you sell, including but not limited to business registration, industry licenses, qualifications, premises and insurance. The platform cannot and will not judge whether your business is legal; please check with your local authorities.",
 "如果你销售食品": "If you sell food",
 "，这还包括食品经营许可、卫生许可、场地要求、从业人员健康证明、家庭厨房经营的相关登记或豁免条件等。各州、各县对家庭厨房和小规模食品销售的规定差异很大，且会变化。": ", this also includes food business licenses, health permits, premises requirements, food handler health certificates, and the registration or exemption rules for home kitchens. Rules for home kitchens and small-scale food sales vary widely between states and counties, and they change.",
 "如果你不具备相应资质，请不要开店。因缺乏资质导致的任何后果由你自行承担。": "If you don't have the required licenses, please don't open a shop. You alone bear any consequences of operating without them.",
 "平台": "The platform ",
 "不承担主动审核你资质的义务": "has no obligation to check your licenses",
 "。但为配合监管机构调查、处理用户投诉或履行法律法规规定的义务，平台有权要求你提供资质证明材料，你应当配合提供。材料仅用于前述目的，平台不对其真实性、合法性承担保证责任，也不因收取过材料而对你的资质问题承担任何责任。": ". However, to cooperate with regulators, handle user complaints or meet legal obligations, the platform may ask you for proof of your licenses, and you must provide it. Such materials are used only for these purposes. The platform does not guarantee their authenticity or legality, and receiving them does not make the platform responsible for any licensing issue of yours.",
 "你在店铺设置里": "Any license or certificate you ",
 "主动上传的许可证或资质凭证，会在你的小店页面公开展示": "choose to upload in your shop settings is shown publicly on your shop page",
 "，任何用户都可以点开查看。请只上传你愿意公开的内容，并自行遮挡证件号码、住址等个人信息。平台不核实其真实性，展示不代表平台对你的资质作出任何认可。": ", where any user can open it. Only upload what you're happy to make public, and cover ID numbers, addresses and other personal details yourself. The platform does not verify it, and showing it does not mean the platform endorses your licenses.",
 "三、商品与服务安全": "3. Product and service safety",
 "你交付的商品或服务的安全性，": "For the safety of the goods or services you deliver, ",
 "全部责任由你承担": "you bear full responsibility",
 "。如果因此对用户造成人身伤害或财产损失，由你直接对用户负责。平台不承担任何责任，但会配合提供订单记录等必要信息。": ". If they cause users personal injury or property loss, you are directly responsible to those users. The platform bears no liability, but will help by providing order records and other necessary information.",
 "，这包括但不限于：原材料来源与新鲜度、制作过程的卫生条件、储存温度、餐具与包装的清洁、配送过程中的保温与防污染。发生食物中毒、过敏反应、异物、变质等事件的，责任全部在你。": ", this includes but is not limited to: sourcing and freshness of ingredients, hygiene during preparation, storage temperature, clean utensils and packaging, and keeping food warm and uncontaminated during delivery. Food poisoning, allergic reactions, foreign objects, spoilage and similar incidents are entirely your responsibility.",
 "销售食品的，你必须在商品信息中如实标注可能引发过敏的成分": "If you sell food, you must accurately list possible allergens in your product information",
 "（如花生、坚果、乳制品、鸡蛋、大豆、小麦、海鲜等），并在用户询问时如实告知。隐瞒或错误标注过敏原可能造成严重后果，责任全部由你承担。": " (e.g. peanuts, tree nuts, dairy, eggs, soy, wheat, seafood), and answer truthfully when users ask. Hiding or mislabeling allergens can have serious consequences, and you bear full responsibility.",
 "四、商品信息真实性": "4. Accurate product information",
 "你必须保证发布的商品名称、图片、价格、规格、成分描述真实准确，不得使用与实物明显不符的图片，不得虚构原材料或产地。": "The names, photos, prices, specs and ingredients you post must be true and accurate. Don't use photos that clearly differ from the real product, and don't make up ingredients or origins.",
 "价格必须是用户实际需要支付的金额。如果有配送费、起送价、包装费，请在店铺设置中明确写出，不得在用户下单后临时加价。": "Prices must be what users actually pay. If there's a delivery fee, minimum order or packaging fee, state it clearly in your shop settings. Don't raise the price after a user has ordered.",
 "五、禁售清单": "5. Prohibited items",
 "不论你经营什么品类，以下内容一律禁止在平台上": "Whatever you sell, the following may never be ",
 "发布或销售": "posted or sold",
 "。这里的「发布」包括小店名称、简介、Logo、商品名称、商品图片、商品描述、下单须知——凡是会展示给用户的地方都算，不只是你实际卖的东西。": " on the platform. \"Posted\" covers your shop name, description, logo, product names, product photos, product descriptions and order notice — anywhere users can see it, not just what you actually sell.",
 "酒精饮料（含酒精的饮品、含酒商品需明确标注且不得单独售酒）": "Alcoholic drinks (products containing alcohol must be clearly labeled, and alcohol may not be sold on its own)",
 "烟草、电子烟及其配件": "Tobacco, e-cigarettes and accessories",
 "大麻及任何含大麻成分的商品，无论当地是否合法": "Cannabis and any product containing cannabis, whether or not it is legal locally",
 "处方药、医疗器械、保健品，以及任何声称有疗效的商品": "Prescription drugs, medical devices, supplements, and any product claiming health benefits",
 "色情低俗内容及相关服务": "Pornographic or vulgar content and related services",
 "烟花爆竹、易燃易爆及危险化学品": "Fireworks, flammable or explosive items and hazardous chemicals",
 "武器、弹药、管制刀具": "Weapons, ammunition and controlled knives",
 "野生动物及其制品、活体动物": "Wildlife, wildlife products and live animals",
 "假冒仿品及任何侵犯他人知识产权的商品": "Counterfeits and anything that infringes on others' intellectual property",
 "他人的个人信息、账号、证件": "Other people's personal information, accounts or IDs",
 "彩票、赌博、代写代考、金融理财与贷款服务": "Lotteries, gambling, ghostwriting or exam-taking, and financial, investment or loan services",
 "任何当地法律禁止或限制销售的商品与服务": "Any goods or services whose sale is banned or restricted by local law",
 "超出你实际经营能力、无法按时交付的商品": "Products beyond what you can actually deliver on time",
 "以上只是列举，不是全部。": "This list is not exhaustive.",
 "法律法规和平台规则都会变，某样东西算不算禁售，由平台结合当时的法律要求和实际情况判定，并动态调整这份清单。平台会尽量提前告知，但你同意接受判定结果和相应的处理措施。拿不准的，发布前先问我们。": " Laws and platform rules change. Whether something is prohibited is decided by the platform based on the legal requirements and circumstances at the time, and this list is updated as needed. The platform will try to give advance notice, but you agree to accept its decisions and any resulting action. If you're unsure, ask us before posting.",
 "六、收款、退款与纠纷": "6. Payments, refunds and disputes",
 "不提供支付功能，不经手任何资金": "does not provide payment and never handles any money",
 "。交易和收款如何进行，由你与用户自行约定。": ". You and the user agree on how the transaction and payment happen.",
 "不提供收款方式的填写或展示功能": "does not let you enter or display payment methods",
 "，小程序内任何位置都不会出现收款账户、收款码或付款指引。你需要收款的，自行在小程序外与用户沟通。": "; no payment account, QR code or payment instructions appear anywhere in the mini program. If you need to collect payment, arrange it with the user outside the mini program.",
 "收款、对账、退款、开具收据或发票，全部由你自行处理。平台不作担保、不做资金托管、不介入退款。": "Collecting payment, reconciling, refunds, and issuing receipts or invoices are all up to you. The platform does not guarantee transactions, hold funds or get involved in refunds.",
 "如果用户与你就订单产生纠纷（未收到商品、商品与描述不符、要求退款等），由你与用户自行协商解决。平台不是纠纷的当事方，也不承担居中裁决的义务，但在收到举报时有权依据本告知书对你的店铺采取措施。": "If a user has a dispute with you about an order (item not received, not as described, refund requests, etc.), you and the user resolve it yourselves. The platform is not a party to the dispute and has no duty to mediate, but when it receives a report it may act against your shop under these terms.",
 "七、税务": "7. Taxes",
 "因你的经营收入产生的一切税务义务（包括所得税、销售税等）由你自行申报和缴纳。平台不代扣代缴、不提供税务凭证、不提供税务咨询。": "All tax obligations arising from your business income (including income tax and sales tax) are yours to report and pay. The platform does not withhold taxes, issue tax documents or give tax advice.",
 "八、配送": "8. Delivery",
 "如果你选择自行配送，配送过程中的一切风险和责任由你承担，包括交通安全、送达时效、商品在途状态。": "If you deliver yourself, you bear all risks and responsibilities during delivery, including traffic safety, timeliness and the condition of goods in transit.",
 "如果你委托他人配送，你仍然对该次配送的结果向用户负责。": "If you have someone else deliver, you are still responsible to the user for that delivery.",
 "九、用户信息": "9. User information",
 "你会看到下单用户的昵称、联系方式和自取信息。这些信息": "You will see the nickname, contact details and pickup information of users who order. This information ",
 "只能用于履行该笔订单": "may only be used to fulfill that order",
 "就这些信息而言，": "For this information, ",
 "你是独立的个人信息处理者": "you are an independent handler of personal information",
 "：由你决定怎么用、用多久、什么时候删。平台只提供把信息展示给你的技术通道，不控制、不干预你的处理行为，也不因此成为共同处理者。你应当自行遵守所在地关于个人信息保护的法律，并独立承担相应责任。": ": you decide how it's used, how long it's kept and when it's deleted. The platform only provides the technical channel that shows it to you; it does not control or interfere with how you handle it, and is not a joint handler. You must follow local personal information protection laws and bear the related responsibility yourself.",
 "禁止将用户信息用于营销推广、转售、提供给第三方，或在订单完成后继续骚扰用户。违反的，平台将直接关停你的店铺，并保留追究责任的权利。": "Using user information for marketing, reselling it, giving it to third parties, or contacting users after the order is done is prohibited. Violations will get your shop closed immediately, and the platform reserves the right to pursue liability.",
 "十、信息披露": "10. Disclosure",
 "发生交易纠纷时，应用户的合理请求，你应当向其提供有效的联系方式，以便协商或通过法律途径解决。": "If there's a transaction dispute, you must give the user valid contact details on reasonable request, so it can be resolved through negotiation or legal channels.",
 "出现下列情形之一时，为保护用户的合法权益，": "In any of the following cases, to protect users' legal rights, ",
 "平台有权向该用户、监管机构或司法机关披露你的身份与联系信息，无须另行取得你的同意": "the platform may disclose your identity and contact information to the user, regulators or judicial authorities without asking for your further consent",
 "收款后失联——联系方式失效或长期不回应": "You disappear after collecting payment — contact details stop working or you don't respond for a long time",
 "收款后不交付，且拒不退款": "You collect payment, don't deliver, and refuse to refund",
 "存在欺诈、跑路等严重侵害用户权益的行为": "Fraud, running off with money, or other serious harm to users",
 "被多名用户投诉且拒不处理": "Multiple users complain and you refuse to deal with it",
 "行政机关、司法机关依法要求披露": "Administrative or judicial authorities lawfully request disclosure",
 "披露范围以解决该问题所必需为限，通常是你在平台登记的名称和联系方式。你在此对上述披露给予授权。": "Disclosure is limited to what's needed to resolve the issue, usually the name and contact details you registered on the platform. You hereby authorize such disclosure.",
 "十一、违规处理": "11. Enforcement",
 "出现以下情况时，平台有权在不事先通知的情况下暂停或永久关闭你的店铺、下架你的商品：": "In the following cases, the platform may suspend or permanently close your shop and take down your products without prior notice:",
 "被用户举报且经核实存在安全或质量问题": "A user report confirms a safety or quality problem",
 "发布或销售禁售清单上的内容": "Posting or selling anything on the prohibited list",
 "商品信息虚假、图文不符、虚假宣传": "False product information, misleading photos or false advertising",
 "收款后不发货、长期不处理订单": "Not delivering after payment, or leaving orders unhandled for a long time",
 "滥用用户个人信息": "Misusing users' personal information",
 "冒用他人身份或资质开店": "Opening a shop under someone else's identity or license",
 "其他违反本告知书或平台规则的行为": "Any other violation of these terms or platform rules",
 "十二、赔偿": "12. Indemnification",
 "如果因为你的经营行为（包括安全事故、资质缺失、虚假信息、侵权等）导致平台或平台运营者遭受第三方索赔、行政处罚、诉讼或其他损失，你应当全额赔偿平台由此产生的全部损失，包括合理的法律费用。": "If your business activities (including safety incidents, missing licenses, false information or infringement) cause the platform or its operators to face third-party claims, administrative penalties, lawsuits or other losses, you must fully compensate the platform for all resulting losses, including reasonable legal fees.",
 "十三、平台不做事前审核": "13. No pre-screening",
 "不对你的店铺资料和商品信息做事前人工审核": "does not manually pre-screen your shop or product information",
 "。你提交后店铺即成立，改资料也即时生效。店铺出现在平台上，": ". Your shop exists as soon as you submit, and edits take effect immediately. A shop appearing on the platform ",
 "不构成对你经营资质、商品安全或服务质量的任何认可或保证": "does not mean any endorsement or guarantee of your licenses, product safety or service quality",
 "平台会对发布内容做机器安全检测，但那只拦明显违规的文字和图片，不构成对内容真实性或合法性的审查。": "The platform screens posted content automatically, but that only blocks clearly prohibited text and images; it is not a review of whether content is true or legal.",
 "平台在收到用户举报并核实后，会下架你的商品或关停你的店铺。被关停的店铺你无法自行恢复营业，如有异议请通过「意见反馈」联系我们。": "Once a user report is confirmed, the platform will take down your products or close your shop. You can't reopen a closed shop yourself; if you disagree, contact us through Feedback.",
 "平台可能不定期更新本告知书。更新后你继续使用店长功能，即视为接受更新后的条款。": "The platform may update these terms from time to time. Continuing to use shop owner features after an update means you accept the updated terms.",
 "小计": "Subtotal",
 "场次": "Session",
 "取货点": "Pickup point",
 "去验证": "Verify",
 "手机号": "Phone number",
 "楼栋": "Building",
 "其他：": "Other: ",
 "名单外的地址，店长确认能送到才会接单": "Unlisted address; the shop owner will only accept if they can deliver there",
 "房间号": "Room number",
 "如 Apt 412 / Room 305": "e.g. Apt 412 / Room 305",
 "补充说明": "Note",
 "写下你的要求": "Tell the shop what you need",
 "（必填）": " (required)",
 "规格、特殊要求等（选填）": "Specs, special requests, etc. (optional)",
 "立即参团": "Join Now",
 "一码开一家店，7 天内有效": "One code opens one shop, valid for 7 days",
 "+ 生成": "+ Generate",
 "暂无开店码": "No shop codes yet",
 "你的小店叫什么？": "What's your shop called?",
 "开店码找明尼助手要，店名和介绍之后都能改。": "Get a shop code from MinnePal. You can change the name and description later.",
 "小店名称（必填）": "Shop name (required)",
 "一句话介绍（选填，做什么、有什么特色）": "One-line intro (optional: what you sell, what's special)",
 "买家去哪取货？": "Where do buyers pick up?",
 "设几个取货点，开团时再选这一场去哪几个。": "Set up a few pickup points; you choose which ones each session goes to.",
 "买家怎么找到你？": "How can buyers reach you?",
 "只有手机号是必填的，其余可以之后再补。": "Only your phone number is required. You can fill in the rest later.",
 "手机号（必填，买家有急事时打给你）": "Phone number (required, for buyers to call if urgent)",
 "小店 Logo": "Shop logo",
 "点击{0}，建议正方形": "Tap to {0}. Square works best",
 "上传": "upload",
 "起送价（美元，不填就是不限）": "Minimum order (USD, leave blank for none)",
 "许可证 / 资质凭证": "License / permit",
 "点击{0}。会在小店页公开展示，请遮住证件号等个人信息": "Tap to {0}. It's shown publicly on your shop page, so cover ID numbers and other personal details",
 "我已阅读并同意": "I have read and agree to the ",
 "《店长责任告知书》": "Shop Owner Terms",
 "上一步": "Back",
 "下一步": "Next",
 "开店": "Open shop",
 "你还没有小店": "You don't have a shop yet",
 "凭开店码开店，之后就能开团接单。": "Open a shop with a shop code, then start sessions and take orders.",
