 "去逛逛市场": "Browse the marketplace",
 "这个板块你还没有在架的内容": "You have nothing listed in this section",
 "TA 在这个板块暂时没有内容": "Nothing in this section yet",
 "功能": "Explore",
 "我的": "Me",
 "酒精烟草、大麻、处方药与疗效宣称、色情低俗、武器管制刀具、假冒仿品": "alcohol, tobacco, cannabis, prescription drugs and health claims, adult content, weapons and controlled knives, counterfeits",
 "对方还没填微信号": "They haven't added a WeChat ID yet",
 "微信号已复制": "WeChat ID copied",
 "明尼助手只展示信息，不经手资金": "MinnePal only lists info and never handles money",
 "下单前请注意": "Before you order",
 "本平台不是经营者，不制作、不配送、不参与交易，仅展示店长自行发布的信息。": "The platform is not a seller. It doesn't make, deliver or take part in transactions; it only shows what shop owners post.",
 "商品、价格、配送时间、安全与质量均由店长负责，平台不审核、不作任何保证。": "Products, prices, delivery times, safety and quality are the shop owner's responsibility. The platform doesn't review or guarantee them.",
 "平台只记录下单意向，不参与交易、不经手资金、不提供担保、不处理退款。": "The platform only records your order. It doesn't take part in the transaction, handle money, guarantee anything or process refunds.",
 "有食物过敏或其他特殊需求，请务必下单前直接向店长确认。": "If you have food allergies or other special needs, always check with the shop owner before ordering.",
 "平台不做事前审核，提交即开店，内容合规完全由你负责": "No pre-screening: your shop opens on submit, and you're fully responsible for compliance",
 "开店前请确认": "Before you open a shop",
 "平台不做事前审核，提交即开店——内容是否合规完全由你负责。": "The platform doesn't pre-screen. Your shop opens as soon as you submit, and you're fully responsible for whether your content complies.",
 "你必须自行确保具备当地法律要求的经营资质，并对商品与服务安全承担全部责任。": "You must have the business licenses required by local law, and you bear full responsibility for the safety of your products and services.",
 "被举报并核实违规的店铺会被强制关停，且无法自行恢复营业。": "Shops confirmed to break the rules after a report are closed, and can't be reopened by the owner.",
 "明尼助手只展示信息，不担保交易": "MinnePal only lists info and doesn't guarantee deals",
 "交易提示": "Trading tips",
 "本平台仅展示用户自行发布的信息，不参与交易、不担保物品真实性和质量、不经手任何资金。": "The platform only shows what users post. It doesn't take part in deals, guarantee items or handle any money.",
 "请当面验货后再付款，尽量约在公共场所交易。": "Inspect the item in person before paying, and meet in a public place.",
 "警惕要求先转账、先付定金的对方，因此产生的损失平台无法追回。": "Be wary of anyone asking for a transfer or deposit up front; the platform can't recover such losses.",
 "明尼助手只展示信息，不核实房源": "MinnePal only lists info and doesn't verify listings",
 "租房提示": "Housing tips",
 "本平台不是房产中介，不提供中介服务，不核实房源真实性，不参与签约。": "The platform is not a real estate agent, provides no agency services, doesn't verify listings and isn't involved in signing.",
 "转租通常需要房东或公寓方书面同意，请自行确认你的租约条款，否则可能违约。": "Subletting usually needs written approval from the landlord or building. Check your lease terms, or you may be in breach.",
 "签约和付款前请实地看房、核实对方身份与租约，押金和租金风险由你自行承担。": "Before signing or paying, see the place in person and verify the other person's identity and lease. Deposit and rent risks are yours.",
 "明尼助手只展示信息，不是用工方": "MinnePal only lists info and isn't an employer",
 "委托提示": "Task tips",
 "本平台不是用工方、不派单、不抽成，只展示用户自行发布的信息。": "The platform isn't an employer, doesn't assign jobs and takes no commission; it only shows what users post.",
 "报酬、时间、责任划分由双方自行约定，平台不介入纠纷。": "Pay, timing and responsibilities are agreed between the two of you. The platform doesn't get involved in disputes.",
 "涉及人身安全、贵重物品或需要专业资质的委托，请务必谨慎并核实对方身份。": "For tasks involving personal safety, valuables or professional skills, be careful and verify the other person's identity.",
 "明尼助手只展示信息，不组织活动": "MinnePal only lists info and doesn't organize events",
 "组队提示": "Group tips",
 "本平台不组织、不赞助任何活动，也不管理任何群，只展示用户自行发布的信息。": "The platform doesn't organize or sponsor any events or manage any groups; it only shows what users post.",
 "群和活动由发起人自行负责，平台与其不存在任何合作或代表关系。": "Groups and events are the organizer's responsibility. The platform has no partnership with or representation of them.",
 "线下见面请约在公共场所，涉及拼车、合租、AA 付款时务必核实对方身份。": "Meet in public places, and verify identities for carpools, shared rentals or split payments.",
 "内容由你负责，微信号会公开展示": "You're responsible for your post, and your WeChat ID is public",
 "发布须知": "Posting rules",
 "你对发布内容的真实性、合法性负责，请勿发布虚假、违法或侵犯他人权益的信息。": "You're responsible for the truth and legality of what you post. Don't post false, illegal or infringing content.",
 "你填写的微信号会公开展示给其他用户，请只填写你愿意公开的联系方式。": "The WeChat ID you enter is shown publicly to other users, so only enter contact details you're happy to share.",
 "内容会经过安全检测，被举报并核实违规的内容将被删除。": "Content is screened for safety, and posts confirmed to break the rules after a report are removed.",
 "虚假信息 / 诈骗": "False info / scam",
